    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/ff35e072fbc480863c1b1546a4593bf0.poster.avif?t=1753728505\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/ff35e072fbc480863c1b1546a4593bf0.webm?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/ff35e072fbc480863c1b1546a4593bf0.mp4?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/9599341c0a273031adc6e793803ba7a0.avif?t=1753728505\" width=800 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the cursed waters with up to 3 friends as you seek forbidden treasures for the mysterious Black Armada. Will you survive what lurks beneath the waves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/2dda2fe079eb7a77b320934e8577a65a.poster.avif?t=1753728505\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/2dda2fe079eb7a77b320934e8577a65a.webm?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/2dda2fe079eb7a77b320934e8577a65a.mp4?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/edb896c607cf66b9819f4570923410b8.avif?t=1753728505\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Chart your course through cursed waters, but beware - these islands hold dark secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Your lantern is your lifeline in the darkness - use it wisely, or face what hungers in the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Race against time to claim ancient treasures, if you dare to venture deep enough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Feel the terror mount as your teammates' voices fade into the distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Keep your ship afloat together, or join the countless wrecks in the cursed depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/a99d5eb71a458527d8f51a967ba030c3.poster.avif?t=1753728505\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/a99d5eb71a458527d8f51a967ba030c3.webm?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/a99d5eb71a458527d8f51a967ba030c3.mp4?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/15145dd70278f4aa789806361c70b94b.avif?t=1753728505\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these cursed waters, your ship is your only hope of survival. But the Black Armada demands more... Will you risk it all and venture deeper, where priceless treasures await - along with unspeakable horrors?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Lurking Horrors:</strong> Every creak, every shadow, every whisper in the dark could be your last warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Your Vessel:</strong> Your only refuge in these cursed waters - keep it intact, or face the horrors of the deep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Ancient Secrets:</strong> Survive each voyage to unlock darker waters and greater rewards - if you dare to return</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/bc0ff4d86b0b076c48fbcb38b628c16b.poster.avif?t=1753728505\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/bc0ff4d86b0b076c48fbcb38b628c16b.webm?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/bc0ff4d86b0b076c48fbcb38b628c16b.mp4?t=1753728505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022470/extras/40a49330216444adb6cf292db34ddde5.avif?t=1753728505\" width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your crew stand united against the horrors that lurk below, or will the dark waters claim yet another vessel? In these cursed seas, death is merely the beginning.</p>",
